{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"五年春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"夏，鄭伯使公子發來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"叔孫豹、鄫世子巫如晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"仲孫蔑、衛孫林父子會吳于善道。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"秋，大雩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"楚殺其大夫公子壬夫。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"公會晉侯、宋公、陳侯、衛侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、齊世子光、吳人、鄫人于戚。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"公至自會。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"冬，戍陳。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"楚公子貞帥師伐陳。公會晉侯、宋公、衛侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、齊世子光救陳。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"十有二月，公至自救陳。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"辛未，季孫行父卒。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"五年春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"王使王叔陳生愬戎于晉，晉人執之。士魴如京師，言王叔之貳于戎也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"夏，鄭子國來聘，通嗣君也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"穆叔覿鄫大子于晉，以成屬鄫。書曰「叔孫豹、鄫大子巫如晉」，言比諸魯大夫也。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"吳子使壽越如晉，辭不會于雞澤之故，且請聽諸侯之好。晉人將為之合諸侯，使魯、衛先會吳，且告會期。故孟獻子、孫文子會吳于善道。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"秋，大雩，旱也。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_21","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"楚人討陳叛故，曰：「由令尹子辛實侵欲焉。」乃殺之。書曰：「楚殺其大夫公子壬夫。」貪也。君子謂：「楚共王于是不刑。《詩》曰：『周道挺挺，我心扃扃。講事不令，集人來定。』己則無信，而殺人以逞，不亦難乎？《夏書》曰：『成允成功。』」","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_22","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"九月丙午，盟于戚，會吳，且命戍陳也。穆叔以屬鄫為不利，使鄫大夫聽命于會。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_23","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"楚子囊為令尹。范宣子曰：「我喪陳矣！楚人討貳而立子囊，必改行，而疾討陳。陳近于楚，民朝夕急，能無往乎？有陳非吾事也，無之而後可。」冬，諸侯戍陳。子囊伐陳。十一月甲午，會于城棣以救之。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_ttr_155_24","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_155","textTraditional":"季文子卒，大夫入斂，公在位。宰庀家器為葬備，無衣帛之妾，無食粟之馬，無藏金玉，無重器備。君子是以知季文子之忠于公室也。相三君矣，而無私積，可不謂忠乎？","sentenceOrder":24}],"overrides":{}}